Z||000000||Cheever2||07-06-2001||07:37 PM||||So I'm going to work and notice some jerk <BR>Who wants to show me that his car is fast<BR>Yeah I'm gettin old but still feeling bold<BR>Wondering if I race him how soon I'd get passed<P>A red light coming up soon so I turn off the tunes<BR>And for this I can do without Air<BR>Trying to act cool, like I barely notice this fool<BR>Tilting my head back so he only sees nose hair<P>Can't locate the driver inside but I do like his ride<BR>A dressed up Accord but tastefully done<BR>Still I think of my Fiero brothers before me who would justly deplore me<BR>If I don't give him a respectable run<P>Almost missed the light change and knew he'd soon be out of range <BR>If I don't get my car quickly in motion<BR>There's the clutch here's the gas I get the jump on him fast<BR>My 2.8 screams like it drank some special potion<P>Kept him 2 lengths behind the entire time<BR>Until we finally had to shut em down<BR>We parted ways and I grinned, thinking let's do it again<BR>Next time I catch you here on my side of town<P><P>------------------<BR>- <I>Chuck Hodges</I> -<BR><A HREF="http://home.houston.rr.com/fieropartsrelay" TARGET=_blank> Fiero Parts Relay</A> administrator||||reg||6
