Z||000002||Cheever2||07-06-2001||08:20 PM||||  <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Was a v6<HR></BLOCKQUOTE>I have no idea what he had in it.  It was quiet, whatever it was. I couldn't hear it over my own exhaust.  I was listening to the radio for a traffic report when I noticed the jerky movements of him trying to challenge me.  Apparently he wanted a rolling start, which would have made me more than happy to accept, but traffic and the light ahead prevented it.  So we cruised up to it, while the car ahead of him got in the left turn lane and the car ahead of me turned right on red, leaving us with a straight, flat, desolate 1/8 to 1/4 mile stretch of road.  The box of kittens was in the lanes going the other direction... I'll have to watch for those when I go home after work.<P><BR><p>[This message has been edited by Cheever2 (edited 07-06-2001).]||||reg||1
